          "id": 1687649587,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "We might want to just drop the `ENABLE_STATIC` CMake configuration variable and note its removal in the release notes.\n\nWe also use `ENABLE_STATIC` as a compile-time definition when building dumpcap and its accompanying static version of wsutil. Removing the configuration variable would reduce a bit of ambiguity there as well.",
