        {
          "id": 1699806477,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> If indicated in release note I think it is acceptable?\n\nI think it would be desirable. Can you add a line to doc/release-notes.adoc saying that `ENABLE_STATIC` is deprecated in favor of `BUILD_SHARED_LIBS`?\n\nI see that the `message` command has a `DEPRECATION` option. Maybe we should just do\n\n```\nif (DEFINED ENABLE_STATIC)\n    message (DEPRECATION \"ENABLE_STATIC is deprecated. Please use BUILD_SHARED_LIBS instead.\"\nendif()\n```\n?",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1789689689",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs"
          },
