        },
        {
          "id": 1699898178,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> Other build systems, like [Buildroot](https://git.busybox.net/buildroot/tree/package/wireshark/wireshark.mk#n195) may depend on it though.\n\nDo they *depend* on it, in the sense that the very structure of the build system *requires* that all packages use it, or do they *use* it for *Wireshark* because *we* documented it use it?\n\nIf the latter, then is there a reason why Gerald's suggestion - perhaps combined with code to set `BUILD_SHARED_LIBS` if it's not defined but `ENABLE_STATIC` is defined - would not suffice?",
          "author": {
