        {
          "id": 1702795970,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "@geraldcombs You suggest I remove in this version `option(ENBALE_STATIC` and just replace it with `BUILD_SHARED_LIBS` ? And for code I use `BUILDING_SHARED_LIBRARY` or a prefixed `WS_BUILDING_SHARED_LIBRARY`.",
